Project Title
EduGenie – Google Gemini Powered Learning Assistant
Problem Identification
Traditional learning systems often provide the same content to every student, regardless of:
•	Learning ability 
•	Prior knowledge 
•	Learning speed 
•	Preferred learning style 
•	Academic difficulties 
•	Individual interests 
Students frequently face problems such as:
1.	Difficulty understanding complex concepts. 
2.	Lack of immediate assistance outside classroom hours. 
3.	Difficulty finding reliable learning resources. 
4.	Spending excessive time searching for explanations. 
5.	Lack of personalized study plans. 
6.	Difficulty preparing for examinations. 
7.	Limited feedback on their answers. 
8.	Lack of motivation and consistent study habits. 
9.	Teachers having limited time to provide one-to-one support. 
10.	Information overload from multiple online learning platforms
Brainstorming Objective
The main objective of the ideation phase is to explore how Google Gemini's generative AI capabilities can be used to create a learning assistant that goes beyond a conventional chatbot.
The system should potentially help students:
Ask → Understand → Practice → Evaluate → Improve
Instead of simply providing answers, EduGenie should encourage students to learn the underlying concept.
