8. Proposed Core Concept
After brainstorming, the ideas can be combined into a single platform:
EduGenie
An AI-powered personalized learning assistant that uses Google Gemini to help learners understand concepts, generate study materials, practice questions, plan their studies, and receive personalized guidance.
The system acts like a virtual AI tutor rather than simply a question-answering chatbot.
________________________________________
9. Proposed Feature Set
A. AI Doubt Solver
Students can enter questions such as:
"Explain recursion in simple terms."
EduGenie can provide:
•	Simple explanation 
•	Detailed explanation 
•	Example 
•	Real-world analogy 
•	Step-by-step explanation 
•	Follow-up questions 
________________________________________
B. Difficulty-Based Explanation
A particularly useful idea is allowing students to select the explanation level.
Example
Topic: Neural Networks
Beginner
Explain it using simple everyday language.
Intermediate
Explain the basic architecture and working.
Advanced
Explain the mathematical concepts and training process.
This enables personalization without changing the underlying subject.
